he arrow keys.","Close the book","textSize","Text size","smaller","Smaller text","larger","Larger text","pageOf","Page {n} of {total}","prevPage","Previous page","nextPage","Next page","Turn pages by itself","autoFlipHint","When the voice finishes a page","on","On","off","Off","theEnd","The end","readAgain","Read again","tapToListen","Tap Listen to start the voice.","Opening the book…","pageError","A picture did not load.","audioError","The recording did not play.","noRecordingPage","No recording for this page yet.","accessEndedTitle","Your access has ended","accessEndedLead","This book is closed for now. Profiles and progress are kept.","devVoice","Browser voice (development only, not the real voice)","testRecording","Test recording","What would you like to do?","readHint","Turn the pages","listenHint","Read along with the voice","watchHint","The film of the story","doHint","An activity together","Test recording: soft ticks, not a voice yet","noRecording","Voice coming soon","noFilm","Film coming soon","noActivity","This story has no activity.","hintTitle","Four ways into every story","hintLead","Read it, listen to it, watch its film, or do its activity. All four are always here.","hintDismiss","Got it","storyCredit","A StoryTime story","authorCredit","The author's own story","lockedTitle","This book is locked","lockedLead","It opens with a pass for its age group. Profiles and progress are always kept.","backToLibrary","Back to the library","progressRead","Read up to page {n}","progressWatched","Film watched","progressDone","Activity done","picture","Placeholder: this picture is not drawn yet","cover","No cover yet","whoIsReading","Who is reading?","whoIsReadingLead","Choose a profile. Each one keeps its own place in every book.","reading","Reading: {name}","changeReader","Change","groupLegend","continueTitle","Continue where you left off","continuePage","Page {n}","continueAction","Continue","nothingStarted","Nothing started yet. Choose a book on the shelf.","shelfLabel","Bookshelf","viewLegend","Show the books as","viewShelf","Shelf","viewList","List","prevBook","Previous book","nextBook","Next book","openBook","Open this book","bookOf","Book {n} of {total}","lockedBy","Opens with a pass for {group}","emptyGroup","No stories in this age group yet.","samplesNote","Books marked \"Sample\" are test books for building the site. The real stories will replace them.","myShelf","My shelf","myShelfEmpty","No favourites yet. Tap the heart on a book to keep it here.","addFavourite","Add to my shelf","removeFavourite","Remove from my shelf","trialOpened","{n} of {total} trial stories opened","groups",{"_66":145,"_68":148,"_70":142},"groupHints",{"_66":666,"_68":667,"_70":668},"months",{"_660":661,"_662":663,"_664":665},{"_59":616,"_419":232,"_617":618,"_619":620,"_621":622,"_623":624,"_625":626,"_627":628,"_629":630,"_631":632,"_633":634,"_635":636,"_637":638,"_639":640,"_641":642,"_643":644,"_645":646,"_647":648,"_649":650,"_651":652,"_653":654,"_655":656,"_657":658,"_659":185},"checkout",{"_25":555,"_556":557,"_558":559,"_560":232,"_561":562,"_563":564,"_565":566,"_567":568,"_569":570,"_571":572,"_573":574,"_575":576,"_577":578,"_579":580,"_581":582,"_583":584,"_585":586,"_587":588,"_589":590,"_591":592,"_593":594,"_595":596,"_597":598,"_599":600,"_540":601,"_602":603,"_604":605,"_606":607,"_608":609,"_610":611,"_612":613,"_614":615},"cancel",{"_25":513,"_59":514,"_515":516,"_471":517,"_518":519,"_61":520,"_521":522,"_523":524,"_525":526,"_527":528,"_529":530,"_531":532,"_263":533,"_534":535,"_536":537,"_538":539,"_540":541,"_542":543,"_544":545,"_546":547,"_548":549,"_550":551,"_552":513,"_553":554},"access",{"_473":474,"_475":476,"_477":478,"_479":480,"_481":482,"_483":484,"_485":486,"_487":488,"_489":490,"_491":492,"_493":494,"_495":185,"_496":497,"_498":499,"_397":500,"_501":502,"_448":503,"_504":505,"_506":507,"_508":423,"_509":510,"_511":512},"trialActive","Free trial, time left: days {days}, hours {hours}","trialStoriesNote","Your trial holds 3 stories. Other stories are locked during the trial.","trialEndedTitle","Your trial has ended","trialEndedLead","The stories are locked now. Profiles and progress are kept.","passEndedTitle","Your pass has ended","passEndedLead","{group}: the stories are locked now. Profiles and progress are kept.","seePasses","See passes","buyNew","Buy a new pass","notNow","Not now","noAccessTitle","No trial or pass is active","noAccessLead","Start the free trial, or choose a pass for an age group.","startTrial","open","Open","locked","Locked","This story opens with a pass for its age group.","sample","Sample","These are sample stories for testing. The real stories will replace them.","interimList","Simple list for now: the bookshelf comes in the next step.","interimStory","Simple view for now: the storybook page comes in the next step.","page","activePass","{group} pass, until {date}","keptNote","Profiles and progress are always kept.","Cancel a purchase","You may cancel a pass within 14 days of buying it, or of receiving the purchase confirmation if that came later.","refund","The refund is made within 14 days of your request. A cancellation fee of at most 5% of the price or 100 shekels, whichever is lower, may be kept.","Access to that pass ends when you cancel. Profiles and progress stay.","trialNote","The free trial needs no cancelling: nothing is charged, and it never turns into a payment.","Passes never renew, so there is nothing to stop.","signedInTitle","Your passes","signedInNone","No pass can be cancelled right now.","confirmTitle","Cancel this purchase?","confirmLead","{group}, {length}. Access ends now. The refund is made within 14 days.","confirm","Yes, cancel the purchase","keep","Keep the pass","Purchase cancelled. Access to this pass has ended and your refund request is recorded. A confirmation is on its way by email.","signedOutTitle","Not signed in?","signedOutLead","Sign in to cancel in one step, or send this form.","email","Email used for the purchase","orderRef","Order number (in the purchase confirmation)","message","Message","send","Send the cancellation request","sent","Your request is recorded. We confirm it by email.","otherWays","Other ways to cancel","contactPlaceholder","Email address and postal address for cancelling: to be added before sales open.","homeLink","homeMethods","Online on that page, by email or by post. Details are on the page.","Check your pass","testBadge","Test checkout: no money is taken.","passLabel","Pass","groupLabel","lengthLabel","Length","startsLabel","Starts","endsLabel","Ends","totalLabel","Total, including VAT","queuedNote","You already have a pass for this group, so this one starts when it ends.","termsCheck","I agree to the Terms of use","rightsLink","Your right to cancel","pay","Continue to payment","processing","Processing. Please keep this page open.","confirming","We are confirming your payment with the payment company…","successTitle","Your pass is active","successLead","{group}, until {date}. A confirmation is on its way to your email.","successQueued","{group}: it starts on {start}, when your current pass ends, and runs until {date}.","failedTitle","The payment did not go through","failedLead","Nothing was charged. You can try again.","cancelledTitle","Payment cancelled","cancelledLead","Nothing was charged.","tryAgain","Try again","toLibrary","Go to the library","toPasses","See my passes","Order number","testPayTitle","Test payment page","testPayLead","This page stands in for the payment company’s page until it is connected. No card is asked for and nothing is charged.","testPaySucceed","Pay (test)","testPayFail","Make the payment fail (test)","testPayCancel","Cancel and go back","amount","Amount","signInFirst","Sign in or create an account to buy a pass.","One pass per age group. A pass opens every story of its group, with everything in it.","placeholderBadge","Placeholder","priceNotSet","Price not set yet","vatIncluded","Price in shekels, including VAT","perMonth","Per month: {price}","total","Total: {price}","paidOnce","Paid once. Does not renew.","choose","Choose {length}","allFeatures","Every pass has every feature. The only difference is how long it lasts.","factsTitle","Before you buy","factInstant","Access starts online right after payment.","factEnds","A pass ends on its end date. We email you before it ends.","factTwoGroups","One account can hold passes for two age groups.","factQueue","A pass bought while another for the same group is running starts when that one ends.","factCancel","You may cancel within 14 days of buying. The refund comes within 14 days; a fee of at most 5% of the price or 100 shekels, whichever is lower, may apply.","factValidity","Prices are not set yet, so no offer is open. Once set, the price shown at the moment of purchase applies.","israelOnly","At launch, buying is for customers in Israel. The free trial works everywhere.","cancelLink","How to cancel a purchase","sellerTitle","Seller","sellerPlaceholder","Business name, ID number and address: to be added before sales open.","trialTitle","Not sure yet?","trialLead","Try 3 stories for 3 days, free, with no card.","trialCta","1","1 month","3","3 months","12","12 months","For children aged 2 and 3","For children aged 4 and 5","For children aged 6, 7 and 8","auth",{"_908":909,"_910":911,"_538":912,"_913":747,"_914":915,"_916":917,"_918":919,"_920":921,"_922":923,"_683":924,"_925":926,"_685":927,"_928":929,"_930":931,"_932":933,"_571":934,"_935":936,"_937":938,"_939":940,"_941":942,"_943":944,"_945":946,"_947":948,"_949":950,"_951":952,"_953":954,"_955":956,"_957":958,"_959":960,"_961":962,"_963":964,"_965":966,"_967":968,"_969":970,"_971":972,"_973":598,"_974":975,"_976":977,"_978":979,"_980":981,"_982":950,"_983":950,"_984":985,"_986":987,"_988":909,"_989":990,"_991":992,"_993":994,"_995":996,"_997":998,"_999":1000,"_1001":1002,"_1003":1004,"_1005":1006,"_1007":1008,"_1009":1010,"_1011":1012,"_1013":1014,"_1015":1016,"_1017":1018},"error